From 3d3a633cf3055c3ce95936739921dd268fd77964 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yeison Delgado <yeisonestivendelgado109@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:49:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(scenarios): demo scenario service for fuses, voltage and
 phases (US31, F-100)

GET /scenarios tells the frontend whether demo mode is on and which
actions exist. POST /scenarios runs OPEN_FUSE, CLOSE_FUSE, CUT_VOLTAGE,
RESTORE_VOLTAGE, DROP_PHASE or RESTORE_PHASE on a fuse or transformer:
it writes the telemetry reading and the Technical Annex alarm event the
device would send, so the map and the alarm list react through their
normal rules. Off unless DEMO_SCENARIOS_ENABLED=true (on for local
docker-compose and Render staging), administrators only, scope applied,
and an action that repeats the current state is refused with 409.

